WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Well, so look

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,500
Now that we have these resources

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,800
We can live longer

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,500
Have you been earning for decades?

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:13,200
It seems to make some sense, right? So we made money.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,700
Then please use the senior's next time

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,600
What if my life is really taken away from me? What are you afraid of?

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,700
Don’t take my life away

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,100
Senior, you have no conscience.

10
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,240
You bad guy with big pig hooves is fine.

11
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,240
Small problem

12
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,340
It’s just a little bit of life, huh?

13
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,380
Rewards to add to your inventory

14
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:33,160
You can place it at any time, right?

15
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,160
magic land

16
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,660
Let's see where to put it, senior

17
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:39,160
Put it in front of the door of Sun Village wherever you can get it

18
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,160
Makes sense

19
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,160
Growing vegetables requires sufficient sunlight

20
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,160
Placement completed

21
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,160
The land is being reshaped
